<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Warm clothes (exposure4 lane). The tailor made only shirts (Recipes_Crafting.xml), so a child born in the
    settlement grew up in one shirt (Insulation_Cold 4: comfortable from 12 C, in danger below 2 C) while the founders
    still wore the robes, pants and parkas they were generated in. In the 600-day arc on 40/201 a quake opened the
    houses in a -11 C frost: every adult lived and eleven children died. The children were not weaker, they were
    undressed.

    RimWorld's tailor makes tribalwear, pants and the parka (recalled, not read), and Biotech dresses children in
    child-sized versions of the same garments (rimworldwiki.com Children page, read: "kid tribalwear", "kid pants",
    "kid parka"). This port has no garment sizes: every garment fits every wearer, so the settlement tailors the
    adult garment and a child wears it. OutfittingInitiative already sizes each bill by the citizens with nothing
    on that layer, so these need no code.

    The robe and the parka are of tanned hide, so they wait for Tanning ("cured hide resists rot and cold"), as the
    hide coat does (Recipes_Armoury.xml), and like it they are made of no stuff. RimWorld's parka needs its own
    research (recalled); here Tanning stands in for it. Pants are cloth, as the shirt is. The parka's 80 is
    RimWorld's cost in stuff (recalled); the other counts and every work amount are this port's own, set beside the
    hide coat's and the shirt's, not sourced.
  -->

  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>Make_Apparel_TribalRobe</defName>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>Tanning</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <label>tailor a tribal robe</label>
    <jobString>Tailoring a tribal robe.</jobString>
    <workAmount>900</workAmount>
    <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter><thingDefs><li>Leather_Plain</li></thingDefs></filter>
        <count>40</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <products><Apparel_TribalRobe>1</Apparel_TribalRobe></products>
    <recipeUsers><li>TableTailor</li></recipeUsers>
  </RecipeDef>

  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>Make_Apparel_Pants</defName>
    <label>tailor pants</label>
    <jobString>Tailoring pants.</jobString>
    <workAmount>600</workAmount>
    <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter><thingDefs><li>Cloth</li></thingDefs></filter>
        <count>40</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <productHasIngredientStuff>true</productHasIngredientStuff>
    <products><Apparel_Pants>1</Apparel_Pants></products>
    <recipeUsers><li>TableTailor</li></recipeUsers>
  </RecipeDef>

  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>Make_Apparel_Parka</defName>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>Tanning</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <label>tailor a parka</label>
    <jobString>Tailoring a parka.</jobString>
    <workAmount>1500</workAmount>
    <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter><thingDefs><li>Leather_Plain</li></thingDefs></filter>
        <count>80</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <products><Apparel_Parka>1</Apparel_Parka></products>
    <recipeUsers><li>TableTailor</li></recipeUsers>
  </RecipeDef>

</Defs>
